{"words": [{"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "تَأْتِيهِم", "translation": "comes to them"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "[of]"}, {"text": "ءَايَةٍۢ", "translation": "any sign"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ءَايَـٰتِ", "translation": "(the) Signs"}, {"text": "رَبِّهِمْ", "translation": "(of) their Lord"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "but"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "they are"}, {"text": "عَنْهَا", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "مُعْرِضِينَ", "translation": "turning away"}], "sahih": "And no sign comes to them from the signs of their Lord except that they turn away therefrom."}